    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d395">

                <pb facs="0749" n="687" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg687"/>

                <head>No. 390.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mathews to Mr. Evarts.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tangier</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-07-05"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 5, 1878</date>.
                        (Received August 15.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 288.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that on
                    yesterday, being the anniversary of the independence of our country, I issued to
                    the foreign representatives a circular, of which the inclosed is a copy, to
                    celebrate the glorious event.</p>
                <p>My circular was cordially responded to by all the foreign representatives
                    accredited to the Emperor of Morocco.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>FELIX A. MATHEWS.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d395-a1.xml" xpointer="d395-a1"/>
            </div>
